## Combo 1: Natural 1ct I VS2 Solitaire — $4,909

This is the combo that makes the $5K budget worth it. A [GIA](https://www.gia.edu/)-certified natural 1ct marquise for $4,049. Add the [Ten Prong Solitaire in 14K White Gold](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/ten-prong-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-14k-white-gold-by-james-allen-item-311235?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) at $860. Total: $4,909.

The stone is [GIA 1.0ct I VS2 Ideal](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/28386475?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational). I color reads near-colorless in white gold — the metal's cool tone masks the faint warmth. VS2 clarity is eye-clean at normal viewing distance. The Ideal cut grade means maximum light return.

