## Combo 4: Natural 0.75ct F IF Floral 18K — $4,131

F IF is the top of the GIA grade pyramid for 0.75ct natural marquise at this budget. F is colorless. IF is internally flawless. In a laboratory sense, there's nothing higher short of FL (flawless). At $1,921, it costs only $33 more than the G VS1 in Combo 3. That's not a typo.

Setting: [Floral Marquise Diamond Engagement Ring in 18K White Gold](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/floral-marquise-diamond-engagement-ring-in-18k-white-gold-item-203738?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) at $2,210. This is 18K gold — higher gold purity than the 14K settings in every other combo.

Stone: [GIA 0.75ct F IF Very Good natural](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/29906705?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) at $1,921.

Total: $4,131.

