| 4 | [Floral 18K WG](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/floral-marquise-diamond-engagement-ring-in-18k-white-gold-item-203738?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | [0.75ct F IF GIA Natural](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/29906705?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | [$4,131](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/floral-marquise-diamond-engagement-ring-in-18k-white-gold-item-203738?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | F IF natural + 18K gold |
| 5 | [Side Stone RG](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/marquise-cut-side-stone-diamond-shared-prong-engagement-ring-in-14k-rose-gold-by-james-allen-item-305149?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | [1.5ct D VVS2 IGI Lab](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/30305195?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | [$4,843](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/marquise-cut-side-stone-diamond-shared-prong-engagement-ring-in-14k-rose-gold-by-james-allen-item-305149?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | Largest stone, rose gold |
| **What this means** | Four settings across WG, YG, RG, 18K WG | Three natural + two lab | $4,131–$4,909 | Match your priority first |

