## How $5,000 Compares to Lower Budgets

| Budget | Best natural option | Best lab option | What changes |
|---|---|---|---|
| Under $3K | 0.50ct GIA natural | 1ct lab D VVS2 | Lab wins on size |
| $3K–$3.5K | 0.50ct GIA natural | 1ct lab D VVS1 | Natural still limited |
| $3.5K–$5K | 0.75ct GIA G VS1 or F IF | 1.5ct lab D IF | Natural 0.75ct opens up |
| $5K | 1ct GIA natural I VS2 | 1.5ct lab D VVS2 | Natural 1ct becomes real |
| **What this means** | $5K is the natural 1ct floor | $5K unlocks flawless 1.5ct lab | It's a meaningful tier jump |

