**By Farzana Hasan, diamond expert**

The $5,000 tier is where the [marquise cut diamond](/marquise-cut-diamond) earns its reputation. You can get a real natural 1ct here. You can get flawless lab at 1.5ct here. You have metal choices, setting choices, and grade choices that don't exist at lower budgets.

The five grade combos above are not a ranked list. They're five different answers to five different questions. Match the right answer to your question first.

