**Best for natural GIA 1ct:** [Combo 1 — Solitaire WG, $4,909](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/ten-prong-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-14k-white-gold-by-james-allen-item-311235?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational). Put 83% of the budget on the stone. The setting is minimal but protective. Nothing else at $5K gives you a GIA natural 1ct.

