**Best grade natural at mid-range:** [Combo 3 — Side Stone WG, $4,238](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/marquise-cut-side-stone-diamond-shared-prong-engagement-ring-in-14k-white-gold-by-james-allen-item-305147?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational). G VS1 + white gold side stone. Clean, classic, under $4,300.

**Best F IF value:** [Combo 4 — Floral 18K WG, $4,131](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/floral-marquise-diamond-engagement-ring-in-18k-white-gold-item-203738?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational). F IF for $33 more than G VS1 is the best value jump on this list. 18K gold is the right match.

